    <sec sec-type="intro">
      <title>Introduction</title>
      <p>Nutrient timing is debated [<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="b1">1</xref>, <xref ref-type="bibr" rid="b2">2</xref>]. Some claim a narrow window (<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="b3">3</xref>).</p>
    </sec>
    <sec sec-type="methods">
      <title>Methods</title>
      <sec>
        <title>Participants</title>
        <p>Participants trained   three
          times per week (<xref ref-type="table" rid="t1">Table 1</xref>).</p>
        <table-wrap id="t1">
          <label>Table 1</label>
          <caption><p>Participant characteristics.</p></caption>
          <table><tr><td>Age</td><td>23 years</td></tr></table>
