    </sec>
    <sec sec-type="results">
      <title>Results</title>
      <p>Lean mass increased similarly in both groups (p &gt; 0.05).</p>
      <fig id="f1">
        <label>Figure 1</label>
        <caption><title>Lean mass change.</title><p>Error bars show SD.</p></caption>
        <graphic xlink:href="f1.jpg"/>
      </fig>
    </sec>
    <sec sec-type="discussion">
      <title>Discussion</title>
      <p>Timing mattered little when daily intake was adequate <xref ref-type="bibr" rid="b4">4</xref>.</p>
    </sec>
    <sec sec-type="conclusions">
      <title>Conclusions</title>
      <p>Trainees may take protein before or after training.</p>
